sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Application
    participant GW as Gateway API (Envoy)
    participant AuthP as Kuadrant AuthPolicy
    participant EPP as llm-d Router (EPP)
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Pod
    participant KServeCtrl as KServe Controller
    participant ODHCtrl as odh-model-controller
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over User,Prom: Workflow 1: LLM Model Serving (Inference Request)

    User->>GW: POST inference request<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.3
    GW->>AuthP: Evaluate per-HTTPRoute AuthPolicy
    AuthP-->>GW: Authorized (Kuadrant/Authorino)
    GW->>EPP: Forward via ext_proc filter
    Note over EPP: Scoring plugins evaluate:<br/>1. prefix-cache-affinity<br/>2. KV-cache-aware scoring<br/>3. load-balanced routing<br/>4. expert-parallelism-aware (EP)
    EPP->>vLLM: Select optimal backend pod
    Note over vLLM: Execute LLM inference<br/>on GPU (CUDA)
    vLLM-->>EPP: Stream tokens (SSE)
    EPP-->>GW: Forward stream
    GW-->>User: JSON response<br/>HTTPS, TLS 1.3

    Note over KServeCtrl,Prom: Background: Platform Reconciliation (continuous)

    KServeCtrl->>KServeCtrl: Manage Deployment or LeaderWorkerSet<br/>HPA/WVA autoscaling<br/>InferencePool lifecycle
    ODHCtrl->>KServeCtrl: Watch InferenceService CRs
    ODHCtrl->>GW: Create HTTPRoutes + AuthPolicies
    ODHCtrl->>Prom: Create ServiceMonitors + MetricsDashboards

