sequenceDiagram
    participant DS as Data Scientist
    participant Dash as odh-dashboard
    participant DashWH as Dashboard Webhooks
    participant KFCtrl as Kubeflow Notebook Controller
    participant ODHCtrl2 as ODH Notebook Controller
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy Sidecar
    participant GW2 as Gateway API
    participant DSPO as DSPO
    participant MLflow as MLflow
    participant Feast as Feast
    participant NB as Notebook Pod

    Note over DS,NB: Workflow 2: Notebook Workbench Lifecycle

    DS->>Dash: Create Notebook via UI
    Dash->>DashWH: Submit Notebook CR
    DashWH->>DashWH: Validate HardwareProfile<br/>Inject Connections (envFrom secrets)<br/>Validate RBAC on referenced secrets
    DashWH-->>Dash: Validated

    KFCtrl->>KFCtrl: Watch Notebook CRs
    KFCtrl->>NB: Create StatefulSet + Service

    ODHCtrl2->>NB: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar
    ODHCtrl2->>GW2: Create HTTPRoute + ReferenceGrant<br/>in controller namespace
    ODHCtrl2->>ODHCtrl2: Configure idle culler

    Note over ODHCtrl2,Feast: Ambient Configuration (automatic discovery)
    ODHCtrl2->>DSPO: Discover DSPA CRs
    ODHCtrl2->>NB: Inject pipeline connection config
    ODHCtrl2->>MLflow: Discover MLflow ClusterRoles
    ODHCtrl2->>NB: Inject experiment tracking config
    ODHCtrl2->>Feast: Discover FeatureStore CRs
    ODHCtrl2->>NB: Inject feature store config

    DS->>GW2: Access notebook via HTTPS URL
    GW2->>KRBP: Forward to kube-rbac-proxy
    KRBP->>KRBP: SubjectAccessReview<br/>on Notebook CR
    KRBP-->>NB: Proxy to notebook pod 8888/TCP
    NB-->>DS: Jupyter/VS Code session

