sequenceDiagram
    participant DS2 as Data Scientist
    participant MReg as Model Registry
    participant MRSVC as MR API Server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL
    participant KServe2 as KServe Controller
    participant CSI as KServe Storage Initializer
    participant ModelStore as Model Storage (S3/PVC)
    participant MRCtrl as MR Controller
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Operator
    participant Dash2 as odh-dashboard
    participant Prom2 as Prometheus

    Note over DS2,Prom2: Workflow 3: Model Registration and Deployment

    %% Registration phase
    DS2->>MRSVC: Register model via UI or REST API
    MRSVC->>DB: Store RegisteredModel +<br/>ModelVersion + ModelArtifact<br/>(MLMD schema)
    DB-->>MRSVC: Persisted
    MRSVC-->>DS2: Model registered

    %% Deployment phase
    DS2->>Dash2: Deploy model version
    Dash2->>KServe2: Create InferenceService CR<br/>with model-registry:// URI
    KServe2->>CSI: Resolve model-registry:// URI
    CSI->>MRSVC: REST API: get artifact location
    MRSVC-->>CSI: S3 path + credentials
    CSI->>CSI: Validate against URI allowlist
    CSI->>ModelStore: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
    ModelStore-->>CSI: Model files
    Note over KServe2: Create Deployment or LWS<br/>Configure autoscaling<br/>TLS + InferencePool

    %% Sync phase
    MRCtrl->>KServe2: Watch InferenceService status
    MRCtrl->>MRSVC: Sync deployment state to Registry<br/>Create ServingEnvironment per namespace

    %% Trust phase
    TrustyAI->>KServe2: Patch InferenceService<br/>with explainability payloads
    TrustyAI->>Prom2: Deploy bias/fairness monitoring

    %% Dashboard monitoring
    DS2->>Dash2: View model status
    Dash2->>MRSVC: Get model metadata
    Dash2->>KServe2: Get InferenceService status
    Dash2-->>DS2: Model serving status + metrics
